				{
					type = "choices"
					long_name = "Acoustic Geometry"
					description = "Overrides how this object contributes geometry to the Steam Audio scene. The modes are mutually exclusive.<br/><b>Default</b>: No change. <br/><b>Exclude</b>: Exclude object form static geometry.<br/><b>Force Static</b>: Consider dynamic object as static geometry.<br/><b>Force Dynamic</b>: Consider object as dynamic geometry, all other dynamic objects are otherwise ignored."
