			name = "logic_case"
			kind = "point"
			description = "Compares an input to up to 16 preset values. If the input value is the same as any of the preset values, an output corresponding to that value is fired.<br><br>For example: if Case01 is set to 2 and Case02 is set to 5, and the input value is 5, the OnCase02 output will be fired.<br><br>This entity can also be used to select from a number of random targets via the PickRandom input. One of the OnCase outputs that is connected to another entity will be picked at random and fired."
