					description = "<b>Cleanup</b>: Reverb bake is disabled. Baked data will be cleaned up during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder.<br /><b>Manual</b>: Reverb needs to be baked manually. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer but untouched by mapbuilder.<br /><b>Auto</b>: Reverb is baked automatically during map compile. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder."
